For units 2, 3, and 4 in docs/migration/units.md, run
one subagent per unit, each in its own worktree. Each
subagent follows docs/migration/pattern.md, runs the
unit's verification command until it passes without
modifying existing tests, commits on a branch named
migrate/unit-<n>, and reports the diff stats and the
test output. Do not merge anything.
